[list]
[*]Home of Great Companies now scores Company Strength: the prosperity of all your companies, divided by 20, so the honour rarely ties.
[*]New: Blue Chips. A company at 70 or more prosperity for 24 months running becomes a blue chip and adds 2 Company Strength. Three months running below 70 lose the status.
[*]Blue chips are shown with a medal badge on the Companies rows of the Speculation tab, with their progress in the row tooltip. The section header shows the count, and hovering it explains Company Strength and blue chips.
[*]New concepts: Blue Chip and Company Strength.
[*]The rival Exchange button now shows on other Exchanges while you have no rival, greyed out with what is missing in its tooltip, instead of staying hidden.
[*]Balance: the Exchange's Deep Pockets investment pool bonus is cut from +0.20 to +0.06 at first place (+0.045, +0.03 and +0.015 below). Measured against vanilla, leading Exchanges had about 1.4 to 1.6 times the investment pool.
[*]Fixed a Great Issue or its cooldown sometimes never ending after loading a save, which blocked floating another. Issues and cooldowns now count down by month.
[*]Fixed a script error when hovering the button to stop pursuing an Exchange name.
[*]Fixed revolutionary journal entries not being inherited correctly.
[/list]
